usage: review_engine.py [-h] {compose,decide,annotate} ...

Light-Science's deterministic visual-review ledger (MIT). This module records
supplied observations. It does not inspect scientific meaning, call a model,
authenticate reviewers, or certify a figure from a numeric score.

positional arguments:
  {compose,decide,annotate}
    compose             Stage two actual images for review
    decide              Record a host-returned review; never launch a reviewer
    annotate            Annotate only committed review observations

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit

